  "ingredients": [
    "1/4 cup almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon coconut flour",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "4 large egg",
    "1/3 cup canned coconut milk",
    "13 ounce canned coconut milk (refrigerated overnight)",
    "1/2 cup powdered stevia/erythritol blend",
    "3 medium strawberries (sliced)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Combine almond flour, coconut flour, salt, and eggs in a blender and mix until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/dairy-free-keto-crepes-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scrape the sides with a spatula and add room temperature coconut milk. Blend until smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/dairy-free-keto-crepes-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the batter rest for about five minutes to finish absorbing any extra liquid.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/dairy-free-keto-crepes-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a non-stick skillet to medium. Add approximately 2 tablespoons plus a bit more of batter to the pan and gently tilt it from side to side until the batter spreads into a thin pancake. It’s not an exact measurement because it will depend on your pan and how thin you want your crepe.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/dairy-free-keto-crepes-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the sides have set, gently lift the edges and flip to cook on the other side, about 30 seconds. Place on a plate and repeat until the batter is gone.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/dairy-free-keto-crepes-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the whisk attachment of a stand mixer or handheld electric mixer beat the cold coconut cream and sweetener together until creamy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/dairy-free-keto-crepes-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill crepes with dairy-free whipped cream and top with fresh strawberries.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/dairy-free-keto-crepes/#wprm-recipe-53333-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
